{'symbol': 'MOS', 'date': '2021-12-09 10:10:00', 'title': 'THE MOSAIC COMPANY ANNOUNCES NET ZERO\xa0GREENHOUSE GAS EMISSIONS TARGETS', 'text': 'TAMPA, FL / ACCESSWIRE / DECEMBER 9, 2021 / TODAY, THE MOSAIC COMPANY (NYSE:MOS) BROADENED ITS COMMITMENT TO ENVIRONMENTAL STEWARDSHIP BY ANNOUNCING TARGETS TO ACHIEVE NET-ZERO GREENHOUSE GAS EMISSIONS IN FLORIDA, U.S. BY 2030 AND COMPANYWIDE BY 2040. TO ACHIEVE THESE TARGETS, MOSAIC WILL EMPHASIZE OPPORTUNITIES TO REDUCE SCOPE 1 AND SCOPE 2 EMISSIONS FROM ITS OPERATIONS.'}